mbstring: multibyte strings (encodings, conversion, case, regular
expressions with oniguruma of the package az).

The module mbstring of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20240924/mbstring.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d,
its headers in include/php84/php/ext/mbstring.
